PLATFORM COMPARISON
-------------------

Railway vs Vercel for this Next.js PWA:

Railway Advantages:
+ Full-stack support (if backend added later)
+ Can add PostgreSQL/Redis easily
+ More flexible deployment options
+ Better for serverless + database projects
+ $5/month free tier with 500 hours

Vercel Advantages:
+ Purpose-built for Next.js (same company)
+ Faster cold starts for serverless
+ Better CDN/edge network
+ Simpler setup (one-click GitHub integration)
+ Generous free tier for frontend apps

Recommendation for this project:
- Vercel: Best for pure frontend PWA (current state)
- Railway: Better if adding backend API or database later

User has both options configured now.

